            <div xml:id="preface">

                <pb facs="0007" n="III" xml:id="pgIII"/>

                <head>Preface</head>
                <p>This volume was prepared under the direct supervision of E. Ralph Perkins,
                    formerly Chief of the Foreign Relations Division. He was assisted by S. Everett
                    Gleason, the present head of the Division. The compilers of the volume were
                    Rogers P. Churchill, William Slany, John G. Reid, and former staff members N. O.
                    Sappington and Douglas W. Houston. Acknowledgment is also made to the historians
                    of the Department of Defense for their assistance in the compilation and editing
                    of this volume.</p>
                <p>The Publishing and Reproduction Services Division (Jerome H. Perlmutter, Chief)
                    was responsible for the technical editing of the volume. This function was
                    performed in the Historical Editing Section under the direct supervision of
                    Elizabeth A. Vary, Chief, and Ouida J. Ward, Assistant Chief.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">William</hi> M. <hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >Franklin</hi>
                    </signed>
                    <lb/>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Director, Historical Office</hi>, <lb/>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Bureau of Public Affairs</hi>
                    <lb/><dateline rendition="#float-left">
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1967-11-06"><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >November</hi> 6, 1967</date></dateline></closer>


                <xi:include href="preface-a1.xml" xpointer="preface-a1"/>
